    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "primary_message": "Heat the oil in a large non-stick or cast iron skillet over medium heat until shimmering. Add lasagna cubes with their cut side down and fry until crisp and browned, about 3 minutes. Flip and brown second side. Serve immediately with sauce for dipping.",
